---
import TextPageLayout from '../layouts/TextPageLayout.astro';
import { site, telHref } from '../data/site';
---
<TextPageLayout title="Accessibility" path="/accessibility" description="WiseMove Senior Advisors is committed to a website that everyone can use, including people with low vision and other disabilities.">
  <p>
    We want everyone, including older adults and people with disabilities, to be able to use this website comfortably.
    We aim to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 at level AA.
  </p>
  <h2>Features of this site</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Text size control:</strong> use the A, A+ and A++ buttons at the top of every page to make text larger. Your choice is remembered.</li>
    <li><strong>Keyboard access:</strong> every link, button and form field can be reached with the Tab key, with a clearly visible focus outline. A “Skip to main content” link appears first.</li>
    <li><strong>Readable design:</strong> large body text, high color contrast, and generous button sizes for easier tapping.</li>
    <li><strong>Help in the same place:</strong> our phone number and a “Text us” link are at the top of every page.</li>
    <li><strong>Reduced motion:</strong> if your device is set to reduce motion, we turn off animations.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Need help or found a problem?</h2>
  <p>
    If anything on this site is hard to use, please tell us and we'll help you another way. Call
    <a href={telHref}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a> or email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>
  <p>[PLACEHOLDER: Add the date of your most recent accessibility review.]</p>
</TextPageLayout>
